  <text>
    <body>
      <p source="#source-259-297"><seg source="#source-259-297">もろの崖より　たゆみなく</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-297-329"><seg source="#source-297-329">朽ち石まろぶ　黒夜谷</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-329-388"><seg source="#source-329-353">鳴きどよもせば　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-353-383"><rb>慈悲心鳥</rb><rt>じふいち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-383-388">の</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-388-428"><seg source="#source-388-428">われにはつらき　睡りかな</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-428-463"><seg source="#source-428-463">榾組み直し　ものおもひ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-463-501"><seg source="#source-463-501">ものうちおもひ　榾組みて</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-501-533"><seg source="#source-501-533">はやくも東　谷のはて</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-533-563"><seg source="#source-533-563">雲にも朱の　色立ちぬ</seg></p>
    </body>
